### Passing an object and number as props to a React component

Source: https://github.com/reactjs/react.dev/blob/main/src/content/learn/passing-props-to-a-component.md

This code demonstrates how to pass an object (`person`) and a number (`size`) as props from a parent `Profile` component to its child `Avatar` component. The `person` prop contains `name` and `imageId` for identification, and `size` specifies a dimension.

```js
