### Create React Profile and Gallery Components

Source: https://github.com/reactjs/react.dev/blob/main/src/content/learn/passing-props-to-a-component.md

This JavaScript code defines two React functional components: `Profile` and `Gallery`. The `Profile` component displays a person's information, including their name, profession, awards, and a dynamic image, using props for customization. The `Gallery` component renders multiple `Profile` components, demonstrating how to pass different data to reusable components. It utilizes a default `imageSize` prop for the `Profile` component and the `getImageUrl` utility function.

